  "headline": "Svipdagr the Cold guide (God of War Ragnarok): one-punish resets while you reduce ranged pressure",
  "description": "In the 3-boss fight, Svipdagr punishes greed. Use one-punish resets after big swings while you reduce ranged pressure first.",
